%% Flow: place a spot order, then fill and settle it.
%% Solid arrow = synchronous call. Dashed arrow = return, async or emitted event.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Trader browser
    participant GW as deploy/gateway.mjs
    participant R as routes/spot.route.js guards
    participant SC as spot.controller.js
    participant LUA as redis.controller.js Lua
    participant RD as Redis
    participant WG as grpc/walletService.js
    participant WA as walletapi
    participant MG as MongoDB _spot
    participant CR as matcher cron 2s
    participant PB as paperBook.controller.js
    participant SK as socket.io

    Note over T,SK: PART 1 - acceptance. Synchronous, returns 200 before the order is persisted.

    T->>T: encryptObject(order) with NEXT_PUBLIC_CRYPTO_SECRET_KEY
    T->>GW: POST /api/spot/orderPlace body token
    GW->>R: HTTP forwarded byte for byte
    R->>RD: passport - re-read userToken, check tokenId
    RD-->>R: session row or reject 401
    R->>WG: blockStoodDownAccount
    WG->>WA: gRPC deactivateWallet mode check, 5s deadline
    WA-->>WG: frozen true or false
    R->>LUA: trackValueFlight - BEGIN_FLIGHT_LUA
    LUA-->>R: registered, or 409 RESET_IN_PROGRESS
    R->>SC: decryptTradeOrder then orderPlaceValidate
    SC->>RD: FetchpairData - hget spotPairdata
    RD-->>SC: pair, or fall back to Mongo
    SC->>SC: assertOrderTradable - depth health and ladder capacity
    SC->>RD: readSpotBalanceNumber - advisory pre-check
    alt Redis balance field missing
        SC->>WG: updateUserWallet to hydrate from Mongo
        WG->>WA: gRPC
    end
    SC->>LUA: hincrbyfloatIfEnough - RESERVE_LUA
    LUA->>RD: EXISTS freeze, HGET, HINCRBYFLOAT in one step
    RD-->>LUA: new balance, FROZEN, or nil
    LUA-->>SC: reserved or refused
    SC->>RD: hincrbyfloat inOrder escrow - SEPARATE, not atomic
    SC->>RD: hset buyOpenOrders or sellOpenOrders
    SC-->>MG: newOrderHistory - NOT awaited
    SC-->>SK: socketEmitOne updateTradeAsset to private room
    SC-->>T: 200 order accepted

    Note over T,SK: PART 2 - matching. Asynchronous, on a 2 second clock.

    CR->>SC: matchingcall per active pair
    SC->>PB: await syncPaperBook at tick top
    PB->>RD: read Binance depth mirror
    PB->>RD: hdel last cycle rows then hset new ladder
    SC->>RD: hgetall both open-order hashes
    RD-->>SC: in-memory snapshot
    SC->>SC: tradeMatching - price-time, self-trade guard
    SC->>RD: settlementCredit buyer base, seller quote
    SC->>RD: releaseInOrder and refundUnspentReservation
    SC-->>WG: passbook audit row - failure logged, never retried
    WG-->>WA: gRPC
    SC->>MG: newTradeHistory and updated order rows
    SC-->>SK: socketEmitOne updateTradeAsset, openOrder, tradeHistory
    SC-->>SK: socketEmitAll orderBook and recentTrade - global broadcast
    SK-->>T: WebSocket frames
